Downloaded by the setup screen (not part of this product)
---------------------------------------------------------

Every file is pinned by URL, size and SHA-256 in crates/qls-core/src/catalog.rs.

- stable-diffusion.cpp by leejet (https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp), MIT:
  official CUDA 12, Vulkan or Metal build of release master-964-1d0a58a
  (https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp/releases/tag/master-964-1d0a58a), which
  includes the MoSR upscaler support contributed by Kokon (pull request #2128). A newer
  official release listed in engine.json of this repository may replace it.
- ggml by the ggml authors (https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml), MIT, included in the
  stable-diffusion.cpp builds.
- NVIDIA CUDA 12 runtime and cuBLAS DLLs (NVIDIA cards only), redistributed in the
  stable-diffusion.cpp release; see https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/eula/.
- Qwen-Image 2.1 Turbo by the Qwen team (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo),
  Qwen Research License (research and evaluation only, no commercial use):
  "Qwen is licensed under the Qwen RESEARCH LICENSE AGREEMENT, Copyright (c) 2026 Hangzhou
  Tongyi Laboratory Technology Co., Ltd. All Rights Reserved." Downloaded as Unsloth's GGUF
