  still use the GGUF conversion by DogukanUrker (https://huggingface.co/DogukanUrker/Qwen-Image-2.1-Turbo-GGUF).
- Qwen-Image 2.1 VAE, from https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1; see
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1 for the terms.
- Qwen3-VL 8B Instruct text encoder and vision projector by the Qwen team, from
  https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-GGUF; see that page for the terms.
